<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Defs>
 <HediffDef>
  <defName>YR_ServiceSac_Exhaustion</defName><label>녹아내릴 것 같은 쾌락</label>
  <description>봉사낭을 이용한 뒤 깊은 황홀감과 신경계의 피로가 남아 몸을 가누지 못하고 있다.</description>
  <hediffClass>HediffWithComps</hediffClass><isBad>true</isBad><initialSeverity>1</initialSeverity>
  <comps><li Class="HediffCompProperties_Disappears"><disappearsAfterTicks>5000~7500</disappearsAfterTicks><showRemainingTime>true</showRemainingTime></li></comps>
  <stages><li><capMods><li><capacity>Moving</capacity><setMax>0</setMax></li></capMods></li></stages>
 </HediffDef>
 <ThoughtDef>
  <defName>YR_ServiceSac_BrideMood</defName><thoughtClass>Thought_Memory</thoughtClass><durationDays>0.41666667</durationDays><stackLimit>1</stackLimit><lerpMoodToZero>false</lerpMoodToZero>
  <stages>
   <li><label>극상의 쾌락을 맛보았어</label><description>봉사낭에서 느낀 황홀한 감각이 여전히 선명하게 남아 있다.</description><baseMoodEffect>10</baseMoodEffect></li>
   <li><label>으헤헤헤</label><description>달콤한 도취감에서 좀처럼 헤어나오기 어렵다.</description><baseMoodEffect>15</baseMoodEffect></li>
   <li><label>오고고고고곡고고고</label><description>깊은 황홀감에 휩싸여 세상의 모든 것이 아득하게 느껴진다.</description><baseMoodEffect>30</baseMoodEffect></li>
  </stages>
 </ThoughtDef>
</Defs>
